{
  "schema": "matforge.flowchart",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "entry": "vending",
  "settings": { "kind": "state_chart" },
  "_comment": [
    "Mealy-style vending machine. Output `dispense` is driven by the",
    "TRANSITION's condition action (depends on state + input event),",
    "matching Stateflow §5-7 Mealy convention. Contrast with the Moore",
    "traffic-light example whose outputs are state-resident.",
    "",
    "Three states (idle / coin1 / coin2) accumulate coin counts. The",
    "`select` event fires `dispense=1` only when in `coin2` (Mealy:",
    "output depends on the current state AND the incoming event); any",
    "other state ignores select. The `reset` event returns to idle.",
    "",
    "Synthesizable through `matlabc -emit-systemverilog`; verilator",
    "--lint-only passes."
  ],
  "flows": [
    {
      "id": "flow_vending",
      "kind": "program",
      "name": "vending",
      "signature": { "inputs": [], "outputs": ["dispense"] },
      "symbols": {
        "data": [
          { "name": "dispense", "scope": "output", "type": "int32", "initial": "0" }
        ],
        "events": [
          { "name": "coin",   "trigger": "rising" },
          { "name": "select", "trigger": "rising" },
          { "name": "reset",  "trigger": "rising" }
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        { "id": "Idle", "kind": "state",
          "data": {
            "entryAction": "dispense = 0",
            "params": { "decomposition": "leaf", "isInitial": "true" }
          },
          "ports": { "in": [{"id": "in"}], "out": [{"id": "out"}] } },
        { "id": "Coin1", "kind": "state",
          "data": {
            "entryAction": "dispense = 0",
            "params": { "decomposition": "leaf" }
          },
          "ports": { "in": [{"id": "in"}], "out": [{"id": "out"}] } },
        { "id": "Coin2", "kind": "state",
          "data": {
            "entryAction": "dispense = 0",
            "params": { "decomposition": "leaf" }
          },
          "ports": { "in": [{"id": "in"}], "out": [{"id": "out"}] } }
      ],
      "edges": [
        { "id": "t_idle_c1", "kind": "transition",
          "label": "coin",
          "from": {"node": "Idle",  "port": "out"},
          "to":   {"node": "Coin1", "port": "in"},
          "data": { "params": { "priority": "1" } } },
        { "id": "t_c1_c2", "kind": "transition",
          "label": "coin",
          "from": {"node": "Coin1", "port": "out"},
          "to":   {"node": "Coin2", "port": "in"},
          "data": { "params": { "priority": "1" } } },
        { "id": "t_c2_idle", "kind": "transition",
          "label": "select/dispense = 1",
          "from": {"node": "Coin2", "port": "out"},
          "to":   {"node": "Idle",  "port": "in"},
          "data": { "params": { "priority": "1" } } },
        { "id": "t_c1_idle", "kind": "transition",
          "label": "reset",
          "from": {"node": "Coin1", "port": "out"},
          "to":   {"node": "Idle",  "port": "in"},
          "data": { "params": { "priority": "2" } } },
        { "id": "t_c2_idle_r", "kind": "transition",
          "label": "reset",
          "from": {"node": "Coin2", "port": "out"},
          "to":   {"node": "Idle",  "port": "in"},
          "data": { "params": { "priority": "2" } } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
